From 8ec69fbc54a5a6b6e37ac4a243f2e7fc29f51881 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sadegh Nakhjiri <sadegh.nakhjiri@stud.uni-duisburg-essen.de>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 20:57:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] oneplus3: Bring up Linux 4.4.302 for LineageOS 18.1 (Android
 11)

- DTS (15801): delete vbmeta node and keep ramoops reserved memory intact
- touchscreen (s3320/s1302): fix stack buffer overflows and __user pointer reads
- ufs-qcom-ice / ufs-qcom: match OnePlus 3 3.18 512B DUN/LBA and CDU mask for /data FDE decryption
- haptics (pmi8994): switch to legacy qcom,qpnp-haptic timed_output driver for Android 11 vibrator HAL
- power_supply & leds-qpnp: add legacy /sys/devices/soc/* parent mapping matching LineageOS 18.1 vendor_sepolicy.cil under SELinux Enforcing
- defconfig: fix missing trailing newline and enable CPUSETS, MEMCG, BLK_CGROUP, SCHED_TUNE, OVERLAY_FS, QTAGUID
